{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方两行超大白字和紫色强调词首先进入视线；随后注意到下方另一句同样醒目的大字。右上角阶段目录较小，正文是连续排列的紫色小字。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他想回去，但说不清自己为什么想回去。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"心慌；似乎害怕孤单，但具体情绪来源不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他想回去的两种动机：怀念曾经被当作自己人的日子，或害怕孤单到愿意再次忍受那些气。心慌是由这个无法分辨的矛盾引起的。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上方主句较长，包含两种动机的对照关系，需要读完整句才能辨清。\",\n    \"核心意思分布在上下两个大字块：上方交代想回去的矛盾，下方交代心慌及不敢继续想，两块需要拼接才能理解处境与感受的关系。\",\n    \"正文小字连续堆叠，形成额外的信息区域。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2d14e584-a9c1-43d6-b771-67ab8f2bdd53", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T012837832260Z", "elapsed_seconds": 34.734, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:29:12.572708+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "64b0a98877bcc3ad0e138a15121ed458b877ddd40be27cc52f27fa6098c37867", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "t